WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.600
Years of photos. Folders everywhere.
Phone backups. Camera cards. That old external drive.

2
00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.200
A clearer home for your memories.
Photos and videos, organized into dated folders.

3
00:00:07.200 --> 00:00:13.600
See the plan. Then say go.
Review your library before a single file is copied.

4
00:00:13.600 --> 00:00:17.600
Years of memories. One clear timeline.
4,000 photos in this demo. A view of what belongs where.

5
00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.600
Copies verified. Originals untouched.
Build your organized library. Keep your source just as it was.

6
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:29.600
Keep the moments. Lose the extras.
Find duplicate photos and videos. Compare similar shots.

7
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.400
Your photos. Your choice.
See the difference. Choose the version to keep.

8
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.000
You decide what goes.
Review the selected extras before approving removal.

9
00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:39.800
To Trash. With your approval.
Selected extras go to macOS Trash.

10
00:00:39.800 --> 00:00:46.200
Changed your mind?
Use the receipt in Run History to restore a trashed file.

11
00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:49.800
Back where it belongs.
A choice you can revisit. A library you can trust.

12
00:00:49.800 --> 00:00:54.400
All on your Mac. No photo uploads.
Your library stays with you.

13
00:00:54.400 --> 00:01:00.000
Your memories. Finally in order.
